cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it and the underlying dataset.
title: >-
  E-GAT-IDS: Edge-Aware Graph Attention Network for MQTT-IoT-IDS2020
  Intrusion Detection
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of an edge-aware graph attention network for
  flow-level intrusion detection on the MQTT-IoT-IDS2020 dataset, together with
  classical, deep and graph baselines, a reproduction of the GA-EBT detector,
  four evaluation protocols and the analysis code that generates every table and
  figure in the accompanying manuscript.
